# Lists with one line per domain crate. Pieces developed in parallel each add a line; `union`
# keeps both sides' lines when merging main into a branch, instead of reporting a conflict.
# (GitHub's merge button ignores merge drivers, so merge main locally: AGENTS.md, "Parallel work".)
# A bad union (say, two edits to the same line) fails loudly: cargo rejects duplicate keys, Nickel
# rejects duplicate fields, and crates/rdx-cli/tests/api.rs checks ops against constructors.
crates/rdx-cli/Cargo.toml merge=union
nickel/rdx/ops.ncl merge=union
